<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2c40fcd0-ef98-4bb0-bfb3-b44d549cbbde> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
