<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2d12358f-60bb-4623-8cab-b7079bb8555c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Two-generation contexts, a `pending` set beside `subsumers` — rejected: `pending` is another `slop_map*` in the same record, so it has IDENTICAL aliasing character; it adds a hazard rather than removing one. Worse, it survives into `Outcome.saturation`, where `extract-findings` can read the uncommitted generation by mistake — a silent over-report of subsumers that were never committed." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2ebe7cd4-2e92-49d1-a14a-d3edca22d1fb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2ebe7cd4-2e92-49d1-a14a-d3edca22d1fb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Leave the fallback profile unspecified when nothing contains the whole ontology — rejected: two conforming implementations would then classify different sub-theories of the same input and return different, equally sound, irreproducible findings." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
