<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/31fc04a3-c194-45dc-9574-162acb1f434e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In-place quicksort — rejected: not stable, so ties would resolve by pivot choice, which is a function of input order and therefore a direct §6.8 determinism violation. Its worst case is also adversarial-input-sensitive on a tool that ingests third-party ontologies." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/31fc04a3-c194-45dc-9574-162acb1f434e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
