<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3479497d-032e-4897-a55c-68d31eb3fe0b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3479497d-032e-4897-a55c-68d31eb3fe0b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reshape the rules into loop patterns the verifier already recognizes (filter/map) — rejected: contorts the hot path, and record-building map loops timed out while completeness was never proved." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
