<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3c8d41fa-b7d8-4f33-8e11-048c9ea600ad> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Wait for the sort builtin proposed in slop-lang/slop#121 — rejected for now: it is designed but unshipped as of 0.2.3, and the maintainer's own ordering puts the strlib.compare NUL fix ahead of it. HOWL's sort is two small functions and can be deleted in favour of the builtin when it lands." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
