<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3c8d41fa-b7d8-4f33-8e11-048c9ea600ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Wait for the sort builtin proposed in slop-lang/slop#121 — rejected for now: it is designed but unshipped as of 0.2.3, and the maintainer's own ordering puts the strlib.compare NUL fix ahead of it. HOWL's sort is two small functions and can be deleted in favour of the builtin when it lands." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3e4c37f3-1379-4df0-83fb-85227d384ddb> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3e4c37f3-1379-4df0-83fb-85227d384ddb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Serve CR4's on-edge trigger from a by-role bucket (∃r.B ⊑ A filed under r, then test B ∈ S(Y)) — rejected: one role such as part_of heads thousands of such axioms while a context holds tens of subsumers, so walking S(Y) is the cheaper side." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
