<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/82f2637e-7bec-4ee2-9068-d3306de638f5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/82f2637e-7bec-4ee2-9068-d3306de638f5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Copy the subsumer sets at round start — rejected: correctness requires copying the WHOLE store before any joining begins, not per-context, so it is O(rounds × |store|) plus a `set-elements` allocation per context per round. That will not meet the within-5x-ELK budget, and buys nothing the commit-at-barrier ordering does not already give." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
