<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/fcaacd9d-661c-4372-aff4-89dc89f80684> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-27T02:25:01.881759Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
