<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/240751ca-9ebe-4ae6-b252-a1bc3ba8b433> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/240751ca-9ebe-4ae6-b252-a1bc3ba8b433> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EL-GALEN is pinned from the DReW copy of the ELK authors' file" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/240751ca-9ebe-4ae6-b252-a1bc3ba8b433> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/240751ca-9ebe-4ae6-b252-a1bc3ba8b433> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The GALEN the §12 benchmark names is EL-GALEN, the variant CEL, Snorocket and ELK report. It is pinned as MANIFEST entry `el-galen` 2011-04-12:\n- **URL:** raw.githubusercontent.com/ghxiao/drew/c8dbd015…/benchmark/galen/ontology/EL-GALEN.owl\n- **sha256:** 4692482660fce56ede0d4587bd8c84af6a8428a62b668cecf976eb1ae4aff4cd (10,401,844 bytes)\n- **Identity:** byte-identical to the ConDOR upload of 2011-04-12 and to galen.owl in ELK's test_ontologies_01.zip.\n- **Content:** 23,136 classes, 950 properties, 36,547 logical axioms (SubClassOf, EquivalentClasses, SubObjectPropertyOf, Transitive), no ranges, chains or inverses.\n- **Licence:** none stated (CO-ODE OpenGALEN origin).\n\n**Conversion.** The source is OWL 2 functional syntax, which rdflib cannot read. fetch.sh first checks it repeats no operand the OWL API would collapse, then converts it with the pinned OWL API (`oracle convert`). That conversion is deterministic (two runs byte-identical), so its output is pinned too, as `derived_sha256`.\n\n**Result:** census finds 0 out-of-profile (an empty projection). HOWL reads it with omitted 0: coherent, 499,983 subsumptions, reason 17.5 s single-threaded at a 22 GB peak. It is diff-clean against ELK." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/240751ca-9ebe-4ae6-b252-a1bc3ba8b433> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/240751ca-9ebe-4ae6-b252-a1bc3ba8b433> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-27T04:57:54.405084Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
