<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/240751ca-9ebe-4ae6-b252-a1bc3ba8b433> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/11c160af-1cdd-477f-9129-c3acd1b88622> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/240751ca-9ebe-4ae6-b252-a1bc3ba8b433> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/444937ae-3451-4673-9a59-50b24b3a585d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
