<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/240751ca-9ebe-4ae6-b252-a1bc3ba8b433> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/bc09a451-8f34-41d2-b4b2-dc715e39a0f3> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2af5ce84-8b18-4688-9777-c316b6ae0f40> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2af5ce84-8b18-4688-9777-c316b6ae0f40> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The corpus differential routes by construct: ELK for GO and EL-GALEN, HermiT for RO and OBI" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2af5ce84-8b18-4688-9777-c316b6ae0f40> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2af5ce84-8b18-4688-9777-c316b6ae0f40> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "`make diff-corpus` (corpus/differential.py corpus) diffs each materialized projection against ONE gating oracle, chosen by the fixture rule (AD 58dfcee6). ELK gates an entry only when it is probe-capable for every census construct in it and has no ObjectPropertyRange; HermiT gates the rest.\n- **GO and EL-GALEN** go to ELK (no ranges).\n- **RO and OBI** go to HermiT (range-bearing).\n- `--also` runs the other oracle, for information only.\n- An oracle that does not finish inside the timeout (default 4 h) is \"no oracle\": a failure.\n\n**Evidence:** corpus/corpus-differential.txt records, per entry, the source and ground hashes, HOWL's report hash, the oracle, and a hash of its entailment lines only (its header names the machine's JVM build). M1 slice 4 results, every ordered pair of named classes:\n\n| Entry | Oracle | Result | Subsumptions |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| RO | HermiT | clean | 275 |\n| OBI | HermiT | clean | 38,681 |\n| GO | ELK | clean | 459,329 |\n| EL-GALEN | ELK | clean | 499,983 |\n\n**Why not HermiT on everything, as in the fixture harness:** HermiT is the confirmed-complete oracle, but on the pure-EL entries ELK is both probe-confirmed and orders of magnitude faster. Measured single-run: ELK 9.4 s on GO and 2.8 s on EL-GALEN; HermiT had not finished EL-GALEN after 22 minutes at 8.6 GB. HermiT on RO (0.9 s) and OBI (2.0 s) is cheap, so the range-bearing entries lose nothing." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2af5ce84-8b18-4688-9777-c316b6ae0f40> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2af5ce84-8b18-4688-9777-c316b6ae0f40> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-27T04:57:54.285997Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2af5ce84-8b18-4688-9777-c316b6ae0f40> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "The corpus differential routes by construct: ELK for GO and EL-GALEN, HermiT for RO and OBI" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2af5ce84-8b18-4688-9777-c316b6ae0f40> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/11c160af-1cdd-477f-9129-c3acd1b88622> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2af5ce84-8b18-4688-9777-c316b6ae0f40> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/b293cf6e-d681-41a0-a895-fbe9eb20d4b7> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
