<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/50b82b38-4887-426f-97b5-7980d62742c8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-22T20:48:36.107948Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
