<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/58dfcee6-dec7-4f9f-8f1e-5c9d93c09fed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/58dfcee6-dec7-4f9f-8f1e-5c9d93c09fed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Range-bearing inputs gate only on HermiT; ELK's range results are informational" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/58dfcee6-dec7-4f9f-8f1e-5c9d93c09fed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/58dfcee6-dec7-4f9f-8f1e-5c9d93c09fed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "In the differential, HermiT gates every comparable input. ELK gates an input only when two conditions hold: every census construct in it passes all of ELK's capability probes, and it has no ObjectPropertyRange at all. ELK's diffs on range-bearing inputs are printed for information and never gate.\n\nThis tightens Constraint b293cf6e, which allowed \"ELK only if the pinned version passes the range probe\". ELK 0.6.0 claims only partial ObjectPropertyRange support, and passing probes does not make a partial implementation complete. Measured: ELK passes 4 of 5 range probes, and on range plus ABox it logs its own Incompleteness warning.\n\n**Routing's inputs are now checked:**\n- A probe's `# construct:` label must be one of its census constructs.\n- Every probe needs a positive expectation that vanishes without its construct.\n- census counts owl:AllDisjointClasses as DisjointClasses; it had been filed as a declaration, which hid n-ary disjointness from routing.\n\n**Input neither oracle can load faithfully is not diffed at all:**\n- repeated operands in a pairwise-read list;\n- an annotation on an annotation.\n\nEach such case has a HOWL fixture pinning HOWL's own answer instead." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/58dfcee6-dec7-4f9f-8f1e-5c9d93c09fed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/58dfcee6-dec7-4f9f-8f1e-5c9d93c09fed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/d610f69d-12fa-4e06-801b-05b3c4efa76f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/58dfcee6-dec7-4f9f-8f1e-5c9d93c09fed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-27T03:01:22.035441Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
