<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/85f90bba-3140-46ac-aa9f-47d76dbd2064> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-11T00:41:33.136149Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
