<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/95f6058d-0d67-49ae-8020-1729e35dfc14> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0d89f4f1-8ee8-40ce-beb2-bacc30ac8f82> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
