<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/95f6058d-0d67-49ae-8020-1729e35dfc14> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/c36de0fb-7ab1-496d-a894-bbbbfda9f009> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a49e3090-ffd6-4031-9cef-142f290e3b85> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a49e3090-ffd6-4031-9cef-142f290e3b85> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The disposition matrix is a catch-all-free match over RawAxiom" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a49e3090-ffd6-4031-9cef-142f290e3b85> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a49e3090-ffd6-4031-9cef-142f290e3b85> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "SPEC §5.2's requirement that the disposition matrix be a total function over RawAxiom is discharged by the compiler rather than by review: `disposition`, `axiom-in-profile` and `render-axiom` (src/owl2.slop) are `match` expressions with no catch-all arm, and the Makefile builds with -Werror=switch so a missing arm is a hard build error naming the variant.\n\nWhy: the two failure modes are opposite and both silent — a permissive default drops an unsupported logical axiom (false coherent), a conservative one marks annotation axioms out-of-profile (false inconclusive on every real ontology). A construct that has no disposition must not build.\n\nSLOP itself only WARNS on a non-exhaustive match; the transpiler emits SLOP_UNREACHABLE() after the switch rather than as a `default:` arm precisely so -Wswitch still fires, which -Werror=switch promotes. Exercised 2026-09-14: adding `ra-inverse-expression` required all three arms before the build passed." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a49e3090-ffd6-4031-9cef-142f290e3b85> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a49e3090-ffd6-4031-9cef-142f290e3b85> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-14T22:57:20.901816Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
