<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b1b29794-7999-4d7d-9ec3-9ab0c63967e7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b1b29794-7999-4d7d-9ec3-9ab0c63967e7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Corpus projections materialize as Turtle, pinned by content" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b1b29794-7999-4d7d-9ec3-9ab0c63967e7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b1b29794-7999-4d7d-9ec3-9ab0c63967e7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "`project.py --materialize` writes each entry's v0 projection to corpus/vendor/NAME-VERSION.v0.ttl (not committed): the pinned source minus the pinned removal list, serialized as Turtle by rdflib.\n\n**Pinned by content, not bytes**, as AD b25fcbb1 already decided for the converted corpus. The file is read back after writing, and every `project-verify` rechecks it when present:\n- its ground-triple sha256 and blank-node triple count must equal the `.removals` header's `projected_ground_sha256` / `projected_bnode_triples`;\n- census must find 0 out-of-profile triples in it.\n\nA drifted projection is never materialized.\n\n**A removed axiom takes its `owl:Axiom` reification with it.** HOWL's stage 0 rebuilds an axiom from its annotatedSource/Property/Target, so dropping a chain but keeping its reification handed HOWL the chain back; RO had three. rdflib gives a reified blank-node target its own nodes, so targets are matched structurally.\n\n**Result:** RO 9,996 triples, OBI 112,148, GO 1,445,042, EL-GALEN 245,662, all census-clean." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b1b29794-7999-4d7d-9ec3-9ab0c63967e7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b1b29794-7999-4d7d-9ec3-9ab0c63967e7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-27T04:57:54.141095Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
