<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/dcd621be-2202-4ec3-a687-84b2d063cfd1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/dcd621be-2202-4ec3-a687-84b2d063cfd1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Inverse property expressions decode to an out-of-profile axiom, not an input error" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/dcd621be-2202-4ec3-a687-84b2d063cfd1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/dcd621be-2202-4ec3-a687-84b2d063cfd1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "`[ owl:inverseOf :p ]` (ObjectInverseOf) is well-formed OWL 2 and excluded by OWL 2 EL (ObjectPropertyExpression := ObjectProperty), so HOWL enumerates it as an omission. In a property axiom (chain step, subPropertyOf / equivalentProperty / propertyDisjointWith / inverseOf operand, domain/range or characteristic subject, AllDisjointProperties member) it decodes to the new `ra-inverse-expression InputRef` variant; as a restriction's owl:onProperty the restriction decodes to `rc-anon`, which the gate's operand check omits. The expression's own `_:b owl:inverseOf :p` triple is structural and read through its user. owl:hasValue on a blank individual likewise became `rc-anon` (anonymous individual) instead of a fault.\n\nWhy: `decode-axioms` turns ANY per-axiom decode error into a whole-run input-error. RO (2025-12-17) writes 10 property chains with an inverse step and 1 subPropertyOf with an inverse object, so a mainstream OBO ontology exited 3 — \"could not run\" — for a v1 construct. After the change RO exits 2 (0 unsatisfiable, 847 omitted). Test: test-inverse-expressions-are-omissions, fixture out-of-profile/inverse-expressions.ttl; mutation-checked." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/dcd621be-2202-4ec3-a687-84b2d063cfd1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/dcd621be-2202-4ec3-a687-84b2d063cfd1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-14T22:57:30.671131Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
