<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/f2ad5629-149e-43eb-a620-10aed5cc57f0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/f2ad5629-149e-43eb-a620-10aed5cc57f0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "External conformance suites check HOWL against answers nobody on the project wrote" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/f2ad5629-149e-43eb-a620-10aed5cc57f0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/f2ad5629-149e-43eb-a620-10aed5cc57f0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "corpus/conformance.py runs HOWL against two pinned external suites. Their sources are fetched by commit and sha256 (corpus/conformance.sha256), never committed.\n\n- **W3C OWL 2 conformance suite** (all.rdf at owlcs/hermit-reasoner 65d38905). Every Approved EL-profile, Direct-Semantics consistency and inconsistency test is checked against HOWL's `inconsistent` line. rdflib converts each RDF/XML premise to Turtle.\n- **ELK's classification tests** (liveontologies/elk-reasoner cc556787). The pinned OWL API (`oracle convert`) converts each input to Turtle. The expected taxonomy, which ELK stores transitively reduced, is closed into the oracle report grammar and compared by entdiff.\n\nA test HOWL doesn't reason over completely is `outside-v0`. Every outcome is recorded in corpus/conformance-status.txt, and a changed record fails the run, so a test HOWL starts omitting cannot silently leave the checked set. A mismatch is never recorded, and `--update` refuses while one fails.\n\nWhy: the capability probes carry expectations written for HOWL by its implementer, and the differential compares with oracles run live. Neither tests the assumptions the fixtures share with the code. The user raised exactly that about the probes.\n\nResult at S3: W3C 38 ok and 27 outside v0; ELK 33 ok and 33 outside v0. The first run found a false coherent (undeclared individuals got no context) and a needless inconclusive (class assertions over blank-node class expressions). Both are fixed, with fixtures." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/f2ad5629-149e-43eb-a620-10aed5cc57f0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
