<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/ff60d323-bdc6-4e9a-ae99-acb6e214e62f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/65db656d-afe2-49bc-80aa-0d3677bca2e9> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
