<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/00c8d432-9c84-4009-b014-485e7060792b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/00c8d432-9c84-4009-b014-485e7060792b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Stage 0 decodes an axiom twice when its reification's target is a distinct but equal blank node" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/00c8d432-9c84-4009-b014-485e7060792b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/00c8d432-9c84-4009-b014-485e7060792b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "`stage0-header` rebuilds a reified axiom unless the document also asserts it, and it tests \"also asserts\" by exact triple identity. rdflib parses an `owl:Axiom` node's `owl:annotatedTarget` list as its own blank nodes, so a reified property chain on RO (e.g. RO_0002215 ∘ BFO_0000050 ⊑ RO_0002216) is decoded twice: once as asserted, once as rebuilt.\n\n**Effect:**\n- **Reasoning is unaffected:** the two copies are the same axiom, and normalization collapses them.\n- **Omission counts can double:** RO's unprojected run listed three chains twice (51 lines for 48 axioms).\n\nRecorded, not fixed, in M1 slice 4. The fix is to compare the rebuilt triple structurally, as project.py's reification matching does." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/00c8d432-9c84-4009-b014-485e7060792b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/00c8d432-9c84-4009-b014-485e7060792b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-27T04:58:08.064422Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/00c8d432-9c84-4009-b014-485e7060792b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Stage 0 decodes an axiom twice when its reification's target is a distinct but equal blank node" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/00c8d432-9c84-4009-b014-485e7060792b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsFrom> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/5bde42ef-92a1-4f07-9071-da1b498203e8> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
