<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2482c304-c758-43be-9e53-53cfbf92816a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Routing depends on census.py's construct labels; a construct census does not see (owl:AllDisjointClasses is consumed as a declaration) is covered only through the DisjointClasses probes, which ELK passes." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
