<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2482c304-c758-43be-9e53-53cfbf92816a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-27T01:25:36.101902Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
