<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/430f1dda-868a-4168-ae0f-a343300284db> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-20T04:37:40.558096Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/430f1dda-868a-4168-ae0f-a343300284db> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Queue list order is bucket order and is not content-canonical, so it must never escape into a report. It does not, because `classify.extract-findings` is the only path out — which makes that function's canonical ordering a determinism obligation rather than a tidiness one." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/55edf275-dd54-42fb-98c9-7b2938ed6bd6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/55edf275-dd54-42fb-98c9-7b2938ed6bd6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The differential needs a JDK to run Gradle and network access once (dependencies, and a JDK 21 via the foojay resolver if the host lacks one); it is therefore outside `make all`/`acceptance`, and CI runs it in its own blocking job with setup-java 21." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/55edf275-dd54-42fb-98c9-7b2938ed6bd6> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
