<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5e87843a-e476-4ef7-827f-75ef9dcd55f5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5e87843a-e476-4ef7-827f-75ef9dcd55f5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "merge-run discards the Bool that list-set returns. It is false only for an out-of-range index, and k is bounded by lo <= k < hi <= n with both buffers holding exactly n elements, so a false means the algorithm is wrong rather than the input. This is not a silent failure: a dropped write leaves a stale index that duplicates one entry and loses another, and test-sort-is-a-permutation checks the multiset — the mutation that disables a copy loop reddens three tests." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5e87843a-e476-4ef7-827f-75ef9dcd55f5> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5e87843a-e476-4ef7-827f-75ef9dcd55f5> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5e87843a-e476-4ef7-827f-75ef9dcd55f5> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-12T05:01:39.400742Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5e87843a-e476-4ef7-827f-75ef9dcd55f5> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "merge-run discards the Bool that list-set returns. It is false only for an out-of-range index, and k is bounded by lo <= k < hi <= n with both buffers holding exactly n elements, so a false means the algorithm is wrong rather than the input. This is not a silent failure: a dropped write leaves a stale index that duplicates one entry and loses another, and test-sort-is-a-permutation checks the multiset — the mutation that disables a copy loop reddens three tests." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/63b3abb0-b1cc-4056-9889-ab04794a0e3c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/63b3abb0-b1cc-4056-9889-ab04794a0e3c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Initialization must commit Δ₀ into the store as well as queueing it, because in this design initialization IS the barrier preceding round 0 — making SPEC.md §6.3 step 4's 'empty subsumers set' a statement about S₋₁ rather than about the state the driver first sees." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/63b3abb0-b1cc-4056-9889-ab04794a0e3c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
