<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/6aba32a1-d21f-4c3b-a7b5-13fab4fafc2a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Known, sound gap left open: nested annotation reification (`_:b rdf:type owl:Annotation`, an annotation on an annotation) is read as an anonymous individual, so the run is INCONCLUSIVE rather than ignoring it (W3C New-Feature-AnnotationAnnotations-001; ELK DisjointSelf after OWL API conversion). census.py makes the same conservative call." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
