<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/8ce27e95-c717-484e-a281-01dabfac330e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "GROWL's fixpoint control skeleton is copied intent rather than reinvented, making the shared-substrate boundary (generic driver vs. reimplemented skeleton) a live design question." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/8e2a3a26-b7f8-4fb8-bc0f-ae06f33031e1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/8e2a3a26-b7f8-4fb8-bc0f-ae06f33031e1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "merge-idx carries NO length postcondition. $result is built by list-push inside while-loops, which the WP checker does not track — it offered alen=0 against a=3 as a counterexample. The obligation is stated in-source and discharged by test-sort-is-a-permutation instead, following the precedent set by make-context's empty-store obligation." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/8e2a3a26-b7f8-4fb8-bc0f-ae06f33031e1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/8e2a3a26-b7f8-4fb8-bc0f-ae06f33031e1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/8e2a3a26-b7f8-4fb8-bc0f-ae06f33031e1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-22T20:48:36.107948Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/8e2a3a26-b7f8-4fb8-bc0f-ae06f33031e1> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "merge-idx carries NO length postcondition. $result is built by list-push inside while-loops, which the WP checker does not track — it offered alen=0 against a=3 as a counterexample. The obligation is stated in-source and discharged by test-sort-is-a-permutation instead, following the precedent set by make-context's empty-store obligation." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/92a4cb95-6836-4ef8-b4b6-566f3f431386> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/92a4cb95-6836-4ef8-b4b6-566f3f431386> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In a v0-only build an ontology outside the v0 language has nothing to escalate to, so the run is inconclusive — never 'coherent'. Once v1 exists this stops being true for a large class of input (inverses, qualified number restrictions), and auto-selection must then select v1 rather than report inconclusive." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/92a4cb95-6836-4ef8-b4b6-566f3f431386> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/92a4cb95-6836-4ef8-b4b6-566f3f431386> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/92a4cb95-6836-4ef8-b4b6-566f3f431386> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-17T22:28:39.964513Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/92a4cb95-6836-4ef8-b4b6-566f3f431386> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "In a v0-only build an ontology outside the v0 language has nothing to escalate to, so the run is inconclusive — never 'coherent'. Once v1 exists this stops being true for a large class of input (inverses, qualified number restrictions), and auto-selection must then select v1 rather than report inconclusive." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
