<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/de1a50af-b72d-45ac-9ab2-a892a5631505> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/de1a50af-b72d-45ac-9ab2-a892a5631505> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Peak memory is now the binding cost, not dispatch: OBI peaks at 3.8 GB (1.8 GB already after the front end), GO at 25.7 GB. A per-round scratch arena for join-phase allocations did not move OBI's peak, so the growth is in long-lived store, queue and parse structures." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
