<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ee1a7a87-9248-4cf8-ab2e-89abf2c6c849> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ee1a7a87-9248-4cf8-ab2e-89abf2c6c849> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The census fixes regenerated OBI's projection and exposed stale MANIFEST figures" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ee1a7a87-9248-4cf8-ab2e-89abf2c6c849> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ee1a7a87-9248-4cf8-ab2e-89abf2c6c849> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The conformance work brought census.py level with HOWL's gate in four places:\n- class assertions over blank-node class expressions;\n- `someValuesFrom` on a data property, including the built-in data properties;\n- `owl:Annotation` nodes;\n- `owl:AllDisjointClasses`.\n\n**OBI.** Five data-property `someValuesFrom` axioms had been counted as in v0. The pinned OBI projection kept them, so HOWL would have omitted them from \"projected\" OBI in S4. OBI was regenerated: 379 → 384 axioms and 5,828 → 5,848 triples removed, with the ground-triple hash unchanged. RO and GO did not move.\n\n**RO.** The MANIFEST's in_v0/out_of_profile for RO were already stale before this work (1465/518 against the census's 1463/520), and nothing checked them. `project.py --verify` now compares every MANIFEST figure (in_v0, out_of_profile, and the three projection_removes counts) with the census and fails on any difference. Restoring RO's stale figure makes it fail.\n\nThis is the census-versus-gate drift S4's reconciliation exists to close, surfacing early." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ee1a7a87-9248-4cf8-ab2e-89abf2c6c849> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ee1a7a87-9248-4cf8-ab2e-89abf2c6c849> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-27T03:01:37.653571Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ee1a7a87-9248-4cf8-ab2e-89abf2c6c849> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "The census fixes regenerated OBI's projection and exposed stale MANIFEST figures" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ee1a7a87-9248-4cf8-ab2e-89abf2c6c849> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsFrom> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e613b055-386a-47e2-8748-192cc59dd02d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/f544fd5c-cdac-44a8-8aff-64dbd2042224> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
