<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/fca77e04-870b-4ee2-9416-5a39f76db57b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-27T01:25:36.191756Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
