<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/f3bcf088-7d14-4136-8c29-8790b8a793e7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "The slop verify boundary, as of 0.2.3 with #168 and #172" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/f3bcf088-7d14-4136-8c29-8790b8a793e7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#learnedFrom> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1b3b494d-9cb4-46d2-b595-58a0cde912f8> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/f3bcf088-7d14-4136-8c29-8790b8a793e7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#learnedFrom> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/85e6f9fb-40ea-497b-b689-3074f1a4ad52> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
